sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as expctl
    participant L as link emulators<br/>(inside each load generator)
    participant G as load generators
    participant P as Prometheus

    loop for each (profile, protocol, repetition)
        E->>L: POST /netem/apply {delay, jitter, loss, rate}
        E->>G: POST /sessions/restart {run_id}
        Note over G: fresh sessions, so STARTUP is<br/>measured under this profile
        opt timeline profiles (burst-loss, degrading)
            E->>L: POST /netem/apply at t=15s, 30s, 45s
        end
        E->>E: warmup 10s (discarded) + measure 50s
        E->>G: GET /sessions/results?run_id
        G-->>E: per-session JSON + per-second timeline
        E->>L: POST /netem/clear
    end
    E->>E: aggregate to summary.csv + summary.md
    G-->>P: /metrics scraped every 5s throughout
